  "prompt": "The function $f$ is defined by $f(x)=x^{2}+8x+15$. The function $g$ is defined as $g(x)=f(x-1)$. What is the value of $g(x)$ when $x=-2$?",
  "choices": {
    "A": "$0$",
    "B": "$3$",
    "C": "$8$",
    "D": "$15$"
